f62dcfe" name="mbi:ExchangeTradedBondFund" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of an exchange-traded bond fund that seeks to track the investment results of an index composed of U.S. dollar-denominated, high yield corporate bonds. The fund is measured at fair value by applying the net asset value per share practical expedient, and is not required to be classified in the fair value hierarchy.</span></ix:footnote></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></ix:continuation></div></div>
