e;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_8446b8e5-b07e-439f-b06e-c2742c2cfe48" contextRef="C_8a58208e-89df-466f-872f-18cf0f878240" name="mbi:ExchangeTradedBondFund" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of an exchange-traded bond fund that seeks to track the investment results of an index composed of U.S. dollar-denominated, high yield corporate bonds. The fund is measured at fair value by applying the net asset value per share practical expedient, and is not required to be classified in the fair value hierarchy.</span></ix:footnote><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"></span></p></ix:continuation></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:2pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Level 3 assets at fair value as of December 31, 2025 and 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> represented approximately </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_05ce856e-18ed-4827-bfd2-d0f24192892a" contextRef="C_94800d3f-3e72-42e2-8a9b-76046f62dcfe" name="mbi:ApproximatePercentageOfLevel3AssetsAtFairValueInTotalAssetsMeasuredAtFairValue" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_1253760e-d0f6-4604-b558-e3748aca4ada" contextRef="C_8a58208e-89df-466f-872f-18cf0f878240" name="mbi:ApproximatePercentageOfLevel3AssetsAtFairValueInTotalAssetsMeasuredAtFairValue" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of total assets measured at fair value. Level 3 liabilities at fair value as of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">December 31, 2025 and 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> represented approximately </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_0faf98ed-7e7a-49c0-86a0-15c202d83334" contextRef="C_94800d3f-3e72-42e2-8a9b-76046f62dcfe" name="mbi:ApproximatePercentageOfLevel3LiabilitiesAtFairValueInTotalLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValue" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_fe8b533f-f03f-4dfe-adad-665e1a09bc4d" contextRef="C_94800d3f-3e72-42e2-8a9b-76046f62dcfe" name="mbi:ApproximatePercentageOfLevel3LiabilitiesAtFairValueInTotalLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValue" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% and </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_f7b83ab8-b602-432d-83d3-fe638a3bf74d" contextRef="C_8a58208e-89df-466f-872f-18cf0f878240" name="mbi:ApproximatePercentageOfLevel3LiabilitiesAtFairValueInTotalLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValue" uni