       </table></ix:nonNumeric></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Following the creation of a litigation trust established to liquidate the Zohar Collateral pursuant to a plan of liquidation that became effective in August of 2022, certain lenders agreed to make term loans to fund the trust that the Company consolidates as a VIE, in an aggregate amount not to exceed the commitment amount. These loans constitute a joint and several liability of the trust and its co-obligors. </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Loans made to the trust bear interest at </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_f89d07c5-38b2-4386-ba12-5a1e9ad89b6a" contextRef="C_95376282-b0ec-45d5-bb53-f30252fbd377" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">18</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% per annum, mature on </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_25384496-c06a-40cf-8ebb-c8090e4ab63e" contextRef="C_a04f861a-7046-409f-90ac-7638ce0aeb9e" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">August 2, 2027</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, and can be prepaid at any time in part or in whole, in some cases subject to certain fees. Accrued interest due on the interest payment date is capitalized and added to the outstanding principal in lieu of cash payment. Loans are secured by recoveries from the litigation claims transferred into the trust. Proceeds received from the settlement of the litigation claims are first applied to the outstanding loan balances and, to the extent of any excess, distributed to the trust beneficiaries or used to permanently reduce the unused commitment amounts.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">During 2025, the Company recognized a $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_6f399b76-ebd3-41cd-9cbf-41c8413ad9d4" contextRef="C_eb27b94d-4f73-496a-a67e-cc493fc15985" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">7</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million gain related to the partial extinguishment of this joint and several liability, which was paid down from proceeds received by a third-party co-obligor. </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As of December 31, 2025 and 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, the outstanding principal balance was $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_d103621d-8238-4971-a738-0eece204c0fd" contextRef="C_36acc873-8f70-412d-8a0a-d7f51a4da3c5" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million and $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_bcc76d41-364d-4784-9bf0-d0d1da0c7a50" contextRef="C_e6c017ce-bc86-42fc-a8a2-803094d8fdda" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">12</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million, respectively. As of December 31, </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, there was </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_3701656d-85ef-4397-841c-8aea5f47d59a" contextRef="C_0ca8502f-af8f-4711-a6cd-975f3ef71a22" name="us-gaap:OtherCommitment" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> unused commitment amount available to the litigation trust.</span></p></ix:continuation></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bot