       </table><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="padding-bottom:1pt;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;border-bottom:0.75pt solid;margin-right:90.667%;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="font-variant:small-caps;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:4.69pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(1)</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> - </span><ix:footnote id="FNT_e17cb2cb-2597-4cf7-9ab8-9a261aa9a69d" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Includes approximately </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_40ea4855-e8c6-4df8-bcfe-7c8232a5c8ab" contextRef="C_59c5d650-7bad-452f-b491-f323b4c8e259" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" unitRef="U_shares" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_3ddae798-d9c0-4fee-b538-179a5a0c51a6" contextRef="C_af940a6c-20ba-4dcc-be82-d72dd90f232e" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" unitRef="U_shares" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_d1a0c258-2b46-4c9f-a2ce-af9e622dc69c" contextRef="C_94b559e1-722d-431f-a464-3bd7e7523f59" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" unitRef="U_shares" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of participating securities that met the service condition and were eligible to receive nonforfeitable dividends or dividend equivalents for each of the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023 respectively.</span></ix:footnote></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
